<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Game Penanganan Dokumen Perkantoran - PT Kuliner Patria Blitar</title>
    <!-- Tailwind CSS CDN -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <!-- FontAwesome Icons -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <!-- Canvas Confetti for victory -->
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/canvas-confetti@1.6.0/dist/confetti.browser.min.js"></script>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap');
        
        body {
            font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
            background-color: #f8fafc;
            color: #1e293b;
            user-select: none;
        }

        /* Custom animations & scrollbar */
        .glass-card {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            border: 1px solid rgba(226, 232, 240, 0.8);
        }

        .drop-zone {
            transition: all 0.2s ease-in-out;
        }

        .drop-zone.drag-over {
            background-color: #eff6ff;
            border-color: #3b82f6;
            transform: scale(1.02);
        }

        .draggable-card {
            cursor: grab;
            transition: transform 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease;
        }

        .draggable-card:active {
            cursor: grabbing;
            transform: scale(1.04);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1), 0 8px 10px -6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }

        .stamp-animated {
            animation: stampPop 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.175, 0.885, 0.32, 1.275) forwards;
        }

        @keyframes stampPop {
            0% { transform: scale(3) rotate(-15deg); opacity: 0; }
            100% { transform: scale(1) rotate(-8deg); opacity: 0.9; }
        }

        /* Custom Scrollbar */
        ::-webkit-scrollbar {
            width: 6px;
            height: 6px;
        }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
            background: #f1f5f9;
        }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
            background: #cbd5e1;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {
            background: #94a3b8;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="min-h-screen flex flex-col justify-between bg-slate-50 text-slate-800">

    <!-- TOP NAVIGATION BAR -->
    <header class="bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-700 via-amber-800 to-amber-900 text-white shadow-lg sticky top-0 z-50">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-3 flex justify-between items-center">
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
                <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-amber-500 flex items-center justify-center text-amber-950 font-bold text-xl shadow-inner border border-amber-300">
                    <i class="fa-solid me-0 fa-folder-open"></i>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h1 class="font-extrabold text-lg sm:text-xl tracking-tight leading-none text-amber-100">SIM-DOK BLITAR</h1>
                    <p class="text-xs text-amber-300 font-medium mt-0.5">SMK Kelas X - Dasar Manajemen Perkantoran</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-center space-x-4">
                <div class="bg-amber-950/50 backdrop-blur px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg border border-amber-700/50 flex items-center space-x-3">
                    <div class="text-center">
                        <span class="block text-[10px] text-amber-300 uppercase font-semibold">Skor</span>
                        <span id="score-display" class="font-bold text-amber-200 text-base">0</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="h-6 w-px bg-amber-700/60"></div>
                    <div class="text-center">
                        <span class="block text-[10px] text-amber-300 uppercase font-semibold">Level</span>
                        <span id="level-display" class="font-bold text-emerald-400 text-base">1 / 4</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <button onclick="toggleMute()" id="mute-btn" class="p-2 rounded-lg bg-amber-800 hover:bg-amber-700 text-amber-200 transition">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-volume-high" id="sound-icon"></i>
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- MAIN GAME CONTAINER -->
    <main class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-6 flex-grow w-full">
        
        <!-- INTRO & STUDY MODAL TRIGGER BAR -->
        <div class="mb-6 bg-white p-4 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200/80 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4">
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-4">
                <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-utensils text-xl"></i>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h2 class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-base sm:text-lg">Simulasi Penanganan Dokumen "PT Kuliner Patria Blitar"</h2>
                    <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-500">Bantu perusahaan kuliner khas Blitar (Pecel, Es Drop, Uceng) mengelola dokumen masuk & keluar secara profesional!</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-2 shrink-0">
                <button onclick="openTheoryModal()" class="px-4 py-2 bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 text-slate-700 font-semibold text-xs sm:text-sm rounded-xl transition flex items-center space-x-2">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-book-open text-amber-600"></i>
                    <span>Modul Materi</span>
                </button>
                <button onclick="resetCurrentLevel()" class="px-3 py-2 bg-amber-50 hover:bg-amber-100 text-amber-700 font-semibold text-xs sm:text-sm rounded-xl transition flex items-center space-x-1">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-rotate-right"></i>
                    <span>Ulangi</span>
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- STAGE NAVIGATION INDICATOR -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-4 gap-2 mb-6">
            <div id="step-tab-1" class="step-tab p-3 rounded-xl border-2 border-amber-500 bg-amber-50 text-amber-900 font-bold text-center text-xs sm:text-sm transition flex items-center justify-center space-x-2 shadow-sm">
                <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-amber-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center text-xs">1</span>
                <span class="hidden sm:inline">Urutan Prosedur</span>
            </div>
            <div id="step-tab-2" class="step-tab p-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white text-slate-400 font-medium text-center text-xs sm:text-sm transition flex items-center justify-center space-x-2 opacity-60">
                <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-slate-200 text-slate-600 flex items-center justify-center text-xs">2</span>
                <span class="hidden sm:inline">Sortir Surat</span>
            </div>
            <div id="step-tab-3" class="step-tab p-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white text-slate-400 font-medium text-center text-xs sm:text-sm transition flex items-center justify-center space-x-2 opacity-60">
                <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-slate-200 text-slate-600 flex items-center justify-center text-xs">3</span>
                <span class="hidden sm:inline">Agenda & Disposisi</span>
            </div>
            <div id="step-tab-4" class="step-tab p-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white text-slate-400 font-medium text-center text-xs sm:text-sm transition flex items-center justify-center space-x-2 opacity-60">
                <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-slate-200 text-slate-600 flex items-center justify-center text-xs">4</span>
                <span class="hidden sm:inline">Master Pengarsipan</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- ================= STAGE 1: URUTAN PROSEDUR DOKUMEN ================= -->
        <section id="stage-1" class="stage-container bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm">
            <div class="mb-6 border-b border-slate-100 pb-4">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                    <div>
                        <span class="text-xs font-bold text-amber-600 uppercase tracking-wider">Level 1 - Konsep Dasar</span>
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-800">Susun Alur Prosedur Penanganan Surat Masuk</h3>
                    </div>
                    <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold">Tarik & Letakkan</span>
                </div>
                <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm mt-1">
                    Sebagai staf administrasi PT Kuliner Patria Blitar, urutkan 6 tahapan penanganan dokumen di bawah ini dari langkah pertama hingga akhir secara benar!
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
                <!-- Source Cards Area -->
                <div>
                    <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-700 text-sm mb-3 flex items-center">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-list-ul text-amber-600 mr-2"></i> Pilihan Tahapan Penanganan:
                    </h4>
                    <div id="stage1-source" class="space-y-2.5 min-h-[320px] p-3 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-dashed border-slate-300">
                        <!-- Dynamic items rendered via JS -->
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Target Drop Slot Area -->
                <div>
                    <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-700 text-sm mb-3 flex items-center">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-down-1-9 text-emerald-600 mr-2"></i> Urutan Alur Standar (1 s/d 6):
                    </h4>
                    <div id="stage1-target" class="space-y-2.5">
                        <!-- 6 Drop slots -->
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 flex justify-between items-center">
                <p id="stage1-feedback" class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-500"></p>
                <button onclick="checkStage1()" class="px-6 py-2.5 bg-amber-600 hover:bg-amber-700 text-white font-bold rounded-xl shadow-md transition flex items-center space-x-2">
                    <span>Verifikasi Urutan</span>
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-check-double"></i>
                </button>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- ================= STAGE 2: SORTIR KILAT SURAT ================= -->
        <section id="stage-2" class="stage-container hidden bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm">
            <div class="mb-4 border-b border-slate-100 pb-3 flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between sm:items-center gap-2">
                <div>
                    <span class="text-xs font-bold text-amber-600 uppercase tracking-wider">Level 2 - Penyortiran Dokumen</span>
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-800">Stasiun Sortir Surat Kuliner Blitar</h3>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
                    <div class="bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 px-3 py-1 rounded-lg text-xs font-bold text-amber-800">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-clock mr-1 text-amber-600"></i> Waktu: <span id="timer-display">45</span>s
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200 px-3 py-1 rounded-lg text-xs font-bold text-emerald-800">
                        Tersortir: <span id="sorted-count">0</span> / 5
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm mb-4">
                Bacalah sekilas judul & pengirim dokumen yang masuk di meja resepsionis PT Kuliner Patria Blitar, lalu masukkan ke boks kategori yang tepat!
            </p>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
                <!-- Current Active Document Card -->
                <div class="md:col-span-1 bg-amber-50/60 rounded-xl p-4 border border-amber-200 flex flex-col justify-between">
                    <div>
                        <span class="text-[10px] font-bold tracking-wider uppercase bg-amber-200 text-amber-900 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">Dokumen Masuk</span>
                        <div id="stage2-doc-card" class="mt-3 bg-white p-4 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-amber-100 space-y-2">
                            <h4 id="doc-title" class="font-extrabold text-slate-800 text-sm">Loading...</h4>
                            <p id="doc-sender" class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium"><i class="fa-solid fa-building mr-1"></i> -</p>
                            <p id="doc-snippet" class="text-xs text-slate-600 italic bg-slate-50 p-2 rounded border border-slate-100">
                                "-"
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mt-4 text-center">
                        <p class="text-xs text-amber-800 font-semibold mb-2">Pilih Boks Kategori Di Samping 👉</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Category Target Buckets -->
                <div class="md:col-span-2 grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
                    <button onclick="sortDocument('Dinas')" class="p-4 rounded-xl border-2 border-slate-200 bg-white hover:border-blue-500 hover:bg-blue-50/50 transition flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center group">
                        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-blue-100 text-blue-600 flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-2 group-hover:scale-110 transition">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-landmark"></i>
                        </div>
                        <span class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-sm">1. Surat Dinas / Resmi</span>
                        <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-500">Undangan Pemkot Blitar, Instansi MUI, dll.</span>
                    </button>

                    <button onclick="sortDocument('Keuangan')" class="p-4 rounded-xl border-2 border-slate-200 bg-white hover:border-emerald-500 hover:bg-emerald-50/50 transition flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center group">
                        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-600 flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-2 group-hover:scale-110 transition">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-file-invoice-dollar"></i>
                        </div>
                        <span class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-sm">2. Dokumen Niaga & Keuangan</span>
                        <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-500">Tagihan Kacang Tanah, Kwitansi, Invoice Suplier</span>
                    </button>

                    <button onclick="sortDocument('Pemasaran')" class="p-4 rounded-xl border-2 border-slate-200 bg-white hover:border-amber-500 hover:bg-amber-50/50 transition flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center group">
                        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-amber-100 text-amber-600 flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-2 group-hover:scale-110 transition">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-bullhorn"></i>
                        </div>
                        <span class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-sm">3. Pesanan & Penawaran Kuliner</span>
                        <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-500">Order Pecel, Penawaran Kemasan Belimbing</span>
                    </button>

                    <button onclick="sortDocument('Rahasia')" class="p-4 rounded-xl border-2 border-slate-200 bg-white hover:border-rose-500 hover:bg-rose-50/50 transition flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center group">
                        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-rose-100 text-rose-600 flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-2 group-hover:scale-110 transition">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-user-lock"></i>
                        </div>
                        <span class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-sm">4. Rahasia / Pribadi Direksi</span>
                        <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-500">Dokumen Segel Khusus Direktur Utama</span>
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- ================= STAGE 3: AGENDA & DISPOSISI ================= -->
        <section id="stage-3" class="stage-container hidden bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm">
            <div class="mb-4 border-b border-slate-100 pb-3">
                <span class="text-xs font-bold text-amber-600 uppercase tracking-wider">Level 3 - Pencatatan & Pengarahan</span>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-800">Isi Buku Agenda Digital & Lembar Disposisi</h3>
                <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">Analisislah dokumen masuk di sebelah kiri, kemudian lengkapi Form Agenda & Tentukan Unit Tujuan Disposisi Pimpinan!</p>
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-6">
                <!-- Preview Letter Left -->
                <div class="lg:col-span-5 bg-amber-50/40 border border-amber-200 p-5 rounded-2xl relative">
                    <div class="absolute top-3 right-3 bg-red-100 text-red-700 text-[10px] font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-red-200">
                        RAHASIA DINAS
                    </div>
                    <div class="text-center border-b border-slate-300 pb-3 mb-3">
                        <h4 class="font-extrabold text-sm uppercase text-slate-800 tracking-wider">PEMERINTAH KOTA BLITAR</h4>
                        <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-600">Dinas Perindustrian dan Perdagangan Kota Blitar</p>
                        <p class="text-[10px] text-slate-500">Jl. Merdeka No. 105, Kepanjenkidul, Kota Blitar</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="text-xs space-y-2 text-slate-700">
                        <div class="flex justify-between">
                            <span><strong>No:</strong> 045/Disperindag/BL/2026</span>
                            <span><strong>Tgl:</strong> 14 September 2026</span>
                        </div>
                        <p><strong>Hal:</strong> Undangan Bazar Kuliner Khas Blitar & Festival Pecel Nusantara 2026</p>
                        <hr class="border-slate-200 my-2">
                        <p class="leading-relaxed">
                            Kepada Yth. <br>
                            <strong>Direktur PT Kuliner Patria Blitar</strong> <br>
                            di Tempat.
                        </p>
                        <p class="text-justify leading-relaxed">
                            Dengan hormat, sehubungan dengan peringatan Hari Jadi Kota Blitar, kami mengundang perusahaan Bapak/Ibu untuk berpartisipasi membuka stand demo masakan <em>Nasi Ampok & Uceng Goreng</em> serta menyediakannya bagi tamu VIP.
                        </p>
                        <p><strong>Tindak Lanjut Diminta:</strong> Konfirmasi kesiapan tim operasional dapur & kebutuhan anggaran stand.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Interactive Form Right -->
                <div class="lg:col-span-7 bg-slate-50 p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200">
                    <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-sm mb-4 flex items-center">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-pen-to-square text-amber-600 mr-2"></i> Form Lembar Disposisi & Agenda
                    </h4>

                    <form id="disposition-form" onsubmit="submitDisposition(event)" class="space-y-4">
                        <div>
                            <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 mb-1">1. Instansi / Pengirim Surat</label>
                            <select id="input-sender" class="w-full bg-white border border-slate-300 rounded-xl p-2.5 text-xs font-medium focus:ring-2 focus:ring-amber-500 outline-none">
                                <option value="">-- Pilih Pengirim --</option>
                                <option value="Disperindag Kota Blitar">Disperindag Kota Blitar</option>
                                <option value="PT Kacang Tanah Kanigoro">PT Kacang Tanah Kanigoro</option>
                                <option value="Hotel Patria Blitar">Hotel Patria Blitar</option>
                            </select>
                        </div>

                        <div>
                            <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 mb-1">2. Perihal Surat</label>
                            <input type="text" id="input-subject" placeholder="Ketik perihal surat..." class="w-full bg-white border border-slate-300 rounded-xl p-2.5 text-xs font-medium focus:ring-2 focus:ring-amber-500 outline-none">
                        </div>

                        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
                            <div>
                                <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 mb-1">3. Diteruskan Kepada Divisi</label>
                                <select id="input-division" class="w-full bg-white border border-slate-300 rounded-xl p-2.5 text-xs font-medium focus:ring-2 focus:ring-amber-500 outline-none">
                                    <option value="">-- Pilih Divisi --</option>
                                    <option value="Dapur Ops">Divisi Produksi Dapur & Event</option>
                                    <option value="Finance">Divisi Keuangan / Accounting</option>
                                    <option value="HRD">Divisi HRD & Umum</option>
                                </select>
                            </div>

                            <div>
                                <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 mb-1">4. Petunjuk / Instruksi Disposisi</label>
                                <select id="input-instruction" class="w-full bg-white border border-slate-300 rounded-xl p-2.5 text-xs font-medium focus:ring-2 focus:ring-amber-500 outline-none">
                                    <option value="">-- Pilih Instruksi --</option>
                                    <option value="Proses">Siapkan tim, peralatan & koordinasi anggaran</option>
                                    <option value="Bayar">Lakukan pembayaran tagihan suplier</option>
                                    <option value="Arsip">Simpan sebagai arsip pertimbangan</option>
                                </select>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="pt-2">
                            <button type="submit" class="w-full py-3 bg-amber-600 hover:bg-amber-700 text-white font-bold rounded-xl shadow transition text-xs sm:text-sm flex items-center justify-center space-x-2">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-paper-plane"></i>
                                <span>Simpan Agenda & Kirim Disposisi</span>
                            </button>
                        </div>
                    </form>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- ================= STAGE 4: MASTER ARSIP ================= -->
        <section id="stage-4" class="stage-container hidden bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm">
            <div class="mb-4 border-b border-slate-100 pb-3 flex justify-between items-center">
                <div>
                    <span class="text-xs font-bold text-amber-600 uppercase tracking-wider">Level 4 - Penyimpanan & Kearsipan</span>
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-800">Sistem Klasifikasi Pengarsipan Dokumen</h3>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full">
                    Sistem Abjad & Subjek
                </div>
            </div>

            <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm mb-6">
                Arsiparis yang bijak menyimpan berkas di lemari odner sesuai Kode Klasifikasi. Cocokkan berkas surat mitra Blitar berikut ke dalam Laci Arsip yang benar!
            </p>

            <!-- Cards to file -->
            <div id="filing-deck" class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-8">
                <!-- Dynamic filing cards -->
            </div>

            <!-- Filing Cabinets Slot -->
            <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-700 text-sm mb-3">Lemari Arsip Utama (Odner Cabinet):</h4>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
                <div id="cabinet-A" class="drop-zone bg-slate-800 text-white p-4 rounded-2xl min-h-[160px] border-2 border-slate-700 flex flex-col justify-between" ondragover="allowDrop(event)" ondrop="handleFilingDrop(event, 'A-D')">
                    <div>
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-700 pb-2 mb-2">
                            <span class="font-extrabold text-amber-400 text-lg">LACI 1 [A - D]</span>
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-box-archive text-slate-400"></i>
                        </div>
                        <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-300">Surat dengan Kata Tangkap Pengirim (A, B, C, D)</p>
                        <p class="text-[10px] text-amber-200/80 italic mt-1">Contoh: Blitar Pemkot, Disperindag, Ayam Lodho Corp</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="filed-items space-y-1 mt-3"></div>
                </div>

                <div id="cabinet-E" class="drop-zone bg-slate-800 text-white p-4 rounded-2xl min-h-[160px] border-2 border-slate-700 flex flex-col justify-between" ondragover="allowDrop(event)" ondrop="handleFilingDrop(event, 'E-M')">
                    <div>
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-700 pb-2 mb-2">
